  "description": "Most bullish stock I am seeing right now....",
  "body_html": "<p>Congratulations to all my fellow <span class=\"cashtag-wrap\" data-attrs=\"{&quot;symbol&quot;:&quot;$LUNR&quot;}\" data-component-name=\"CashtagToDOM\"></span> holders. I <a href=\"https://tjstocks.substack.com/p/2-stocks-trending-higher-now\">shared Intuitive Machines last week</a>, and we <strong>peaked at +33% in just 6 days! </strong>Please recall, this trade was a short term cash grab…I do not intend to hold it for long, especially not past June 12, the date when Space X is supposed to IPO. You can now comfortably move your stop into profit, and we will ride this rocket for as long as we can hold on. </p><p>Additionally, out of the 13 positions, 10 are in the profit, and 5 of them are well over 20% profit. Xometry and the “croissant” setup is leading the charge at +27%. Average gain is 9% and net sum % gain is 116%. </p><p>As we proceed into what appears to be a very bullish week, some of these questions have popped up in the <a href=\"https://open.substack.com/chat/posts/b7f4035d-fcb6-44e8-911b-6712dbc96cb7\">Main Chat</a>, that I think many others will want to know as well. </p><ol><li><p>What is LUNR’s top price target prediction? More runway ahead?</p></li><li><p>What are your thoughts on the Space X IPO, its getting a lot of hype?</p></li><li><p>Is the Stock Market entering the blow off top stage? When melt-down?</p></li><li><p>When should we begin trimming APLD and XMTR? Are portfolio leaders are  both approaching 30% profit.  </p></li><li><p><strong>What’s the most bullish stock out there right now? Yes, I am buying.</strong></p></li></ol>",
  "has_dynamic_content": false,
  "truncated_body_text": "Congratulations to all my fellow holders. I shared Intuitive Machines last week, and we peaked at +33% in just 6 days! Please recall, this trade was a short term cash grab…I do not intend to hold it for long, especially not past June 12, the date when Space X is supposed to IPO. You can now comfortably move your stop into profit, and we will ride this rocket for as long as we can hold on.",
